# Build context hygiene.
#
# Without this file the whole working tree is shipped to the daemon on every
# build: host `node_modules` (Windows binaries for better-sqlite3 and
# @next/swc would overwrite the musl ones built in the deps stage), `.next`
# (stale output), `data/` (a live SQLite database), and `.env` — which Next
# traces into `.next/standalone`, putting a working dev SESSION_SECRET and the
# root admin password inside an image layer.

node_modules
.next
out
coverage
data
tests
docs

# Secrets and local state
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.log

# Tooling noise
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
